A '''Primordial Eye''' is a {{Legendary}} item dropped by the {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}} {{SlayerTier|V}} or higher after reaching {{Coll|Spider Slayer VII}}. 

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
A {{Stier|V}} {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}} has a {{Chance|0.014%|1|7,026.5|kills}} to drop a '''Primordial Eye''' if the player has reached {{Coll|Spider Slayer VII}}.

=== Raffle of the Century ===
'''Primordial Eye''' can also be obtained as a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].

